Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Polar Games disc on 64-bit Windows: install WildTangent to C:\WildTangent instead of
; "C:\Program Files (x86)\WildTangent". The installer chokes on the "(x86)" parentheses.
; Double-click this BEFORE running the disc installer.
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\WOW6432Node\WildTangent]
"wtRoot"="C:\\WildTangent\\"
